graph LR
    U[User Request] --> AI[Central AI Core]
    AI --> DP[Request Chunking]
    DP --> N[Participant User Network]
    N --> P[Parallel Processing]
    P --> RC[Result Reassembly]
    RC --> U[Return Result to User]
    
    subgraph User Network
        N1[User Device 1]
        N2[User Device 2]
        N3[User Device 3]
        N4[User Device 4]
        N5[User Device 5]
    end
    
    style U fill:#e1f5fe
    style AI fill:#fff3e0
    style N fill:#c8e6c9
